{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodevertical"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"case","roleHeading":"Enumeration Case","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","externalID":"c:@E@MLNTextWritingMode@MLNTextWritingModeVertical","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeVertical","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"If a text’s language supports vertical writing mode, symbols with point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placement would be laid out vertically.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingMode"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The property allows control over a symbol’s orientation. Note that the property","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values act as a hint, so that a symbol whose language doesn’t support the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provided orientation will be laid out in its natural orientation. Example:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"English point symbol will be rendered horizontally even if array value contains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single ‘vertical’ enum value. The order of elements in an array define priority","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order for the placement of an orientation variant.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNTextWritingMode","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode/MLNTextWritingModeVertical":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"If a text’s language supports vertical writing mode, symbols with point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placement would be laid out vertically.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeVertical","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodevertical"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"}}}